  3b. THE LEVELS STORE BEHIND IT, which carries the DEPTH of each channel
     61 species level tables, 9,200 level lines, neutrals and ions to core charge 10
     34 of the 61 carry a g term in their levels
     MEASUREMENTS.tsv: 554 channels, of which 12 are g and 1 is h
       species   term         members   n range     delta
       Ba I      3G                29      8-25   0.05145
       Cs I      2G                28      5-25   0.00667
       Ba I      1G                18      8-25   0.05072
       Na I      2G                18      5-20   0.00042
       Hg I      3G                 9      5-11   0.00379
       Ge I      (1/2,7/2)*         8      6-15   0.00683
